      "no": 633,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我好像感冒了，头有点儿疼。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ hǎoxiàng gǎnmào le, tóu yǒudiǎnr téng.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0633-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 44.975,
      "end": 47.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.875,
      "sha256": "f71a04a08185cc4b625ce7c929d1882498c9ed52e3f91f95153f51afb2fb46cb"
    },
    {
      "no": 646,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "昨天跑得太久，今天腿有点儿疼。",
      "pinyin": "Zuótiān pǎo de tài jiǔ, jīntiān tuǐ yǒudiǎnr téng.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0646-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 47.85,
      "end": 51.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "sha256": "16f89bb641add81e6b5d2d48d07876420257cf4b35b107babeddcf726ebfb805"
    },
    {
      "no": 662,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "饭太热了，放一会儿再吃。",
      "pinyin": "Fàn tài rè le, fàng yíhuìr zài chī.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0662-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 51.4,
      "end": 54.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "sha256": "e9c2f6b440ce6e92e1169da34c900aced3c7ee922b49e6c79715eff7a745fabb"
    },
    {
      "no": 664,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "天阴了，可能一会儿就下雨。",
      "pinyin": "Tiān yīn le, kěnéng yíhuìr jiù xiàyǔ.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0664-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 54.04,
      "end": 56.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "sha256": "bddf098df61c59d2dbddc15afbeb190d6de74572cb800400401516b4c40400a2"
    },
    {
      "no": 667,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "雨后的地不好走，要慢一点儿。",
      "pinyin": "Yǔ hòu de dì bù hǎo zǒu, yào màn yìdiǎnr.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0667-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 56.88,
      "end": 59.735,
      "duration_seconds": 2.855,
      "sha256": "bb5d1ff3dd1fc51b5dcb2cd50b051898c87da1782b05cba21ed2e0175fb89803"
    },
    {
      "no": 681,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "雨还没停，我们再等一会儿。",
      "pinyin": "Yǔ hái méi tíng, wǒmen zài děng yíhuìr.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0681-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 59.735,
      "end": 62.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.775,
      "sha256": "6555eecfa6049a762e22b47a3ee3a282591fc93d80e40126a736f397d99ce94b"
    },
    {
      "no": 701,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "周末体育馆的人多，早点儿去吧。",
      "pinyin": "Zhōumò tǐyùguǎn de rén duō, zǎo diǎnr qù ba.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0701-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 62.51,
      "end": 65.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "sha256": "c10a32d9dcf3347a0fa2b3ee973e46cab654ccfa8dc6c89418bcf95a4087a64a"
    },
    {
      "no": 721,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "这个地方好玩儿吗？我也想去。",
      "pinyin": "Zhège dìfang hǎowánr ma? wǒ yě xiǎng qù.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0721-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 65.55,
      "end": 68.195,
      "duration_seconds": 2.645,
      "sha256": "f148dedb48765e69b45f9e880bc178e547342c495341b6af9affa7636e19d035"
    },
    {
      "no": 722,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "跟不同国家的人聊天儿很有意思。",
      "pinyin": "Gēn bùtóng guójiā de rén liáotiānr hěn yǒuyìsi.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0722-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 68.195,
      "end": 71.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.185,
      "sha256": "aad951d68c999478ab9b684550ac9fe1222f03fe8d9eca54a0e46a26f17bef9d"
    },
    {
      "no": 726,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我想多了解一点儿这座城市的历史。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ xiǎng duō liǎojiě yìdiǎnr zhè zuò chéngshì de lìshǐ.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0726-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 71.38,
      "end": 74.605,
      "duration_seconds": 3.225,
      "sha256": "4e94234b114c6412fefdbf3d4816c2502ceb4a11c9c5cfb6b51049deb1f56afd"
    },
    {
      "no": 748,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "请讲慢一点儿，我还没听明白。",
      "pinyin": "Qǐng jiǎng màn yìdiǎnr, wǒ hái méi tīng míngbai.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0748-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 74.605,
      "end": 77.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.965,
      "sha256": "7f4e82c4c457d9a3916be6793fa73197ad043e7f692b70ddeb9a4703a0c91011"
    },
    {
      "no": 750,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "周末我想找你喝茶聊天儿。",
      "pinyin": "Zhōumò wǒ xiǎng zhǎo nǐ hē chá liáotiānr.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0750-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 77.57,
      "end": 80.265,
      "duration_seconds": 2.695,
      "sha256": "28e52f8b87d7cd7a0853d26e75d744af446775bee25a3a68cbf4026765b2eb12"
    },
    {
      "no": 752,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "电视声音太大，能小一点儿吗？",
      "pinyin": "Diànshì shēngyīn tài dà, néng xiǎo yìdiǎnr ma?",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0752-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 3,
      "start": 80.265,
      "end": 83.232,
      "duration_seconds": 2.967,
      "sha256": "f54f7d0ab187894ed6965dad4f6b8ff5fb6e46a34f8c1bef41487f49d7a89780"
    },
    {
      "no": 761,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "大熊猫正在吃东西，我们小声一点儿。",
      "pinyin": "Dàxióngmāo zhèngzài chī dōngxi, wǒmen xiǎoshēng yìdiǎnr.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0761-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "sha256": "8ded2c82f34872ca07e0f7d9f2ea75ec474f098bd5ee6b9f7e06a1d16f9ef857"
    },
    {
      "no": 768,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "请把杯子放高一点儿，别让孩子拿到。",
      "pinyin": "Qǐng bǎ bēizi fàng gāo yìdiǎnr, bié ràng háizi ná dào.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0768-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 2.77,
      "end": 5.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "sha256": "c2bd0073f274a864cd2ef2fb6791d2639e58ceb043b5e0dc37bbf9d64eba4978"
    },
    {
      "no": 777,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "告诉我你在哪儿，我马上去接你。",
      "pinyin": "Gàosu wǒ nǐ zài nǎr, wǒ mǎshàng qù jiē nǐ.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0777-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 5.55,
      "end": 8.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "sha256": "35bc8da2e6250b9d6c278dad29aa8dd90a5634f830b0d230790581c9edc13088"
    },
    {
      "no": 800,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我喜欢跟能让我开心的人聊天儿。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ xǐhuan gēn néng ràng wǒ kāixīn de rén liáotiānr.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0800-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 8.04,
      "end": 10.435,
      "duration_seconds": 2.395,
      "sha256": "fce1f6295f6eaa70b70d6a368710b3aba7c0988769dae62a587f6f21c2b8378a"
    },
    {
      "no": 819,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "没想到在这儿遇见你，真高兴。",
      "pinyin": "Méixiǎngdào zài zhèr yùjiàn nǐ, zhēn gāoxìng.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0819-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 10.435,
      "end": 12.845,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "sha256": "189225bdcd6c839e2de98bc98673e03505e0994a8083a3ad8a4b9c1a73ec13b1"
    },
    {
      "no": 828,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我有点儿害怕一个人坐飞机。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ yǒudiǎnr hàipà yí ge rén zuò fēijī.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0828-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 12.845,
      "end": 14.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.125,
      "sha256": "ac4b2281c7e4bab7ba3374fb91b7ffedc6fc559a4edebd32dfcabf5e4872ea8c"
    },
    {
      "no": 838,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "等了半天还没见他来，我有点儿着急。",
      "pinyin": "Děng le bàntiān hái méi jiàn tā lái, wǒ yǒudiǎnr zháojí.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0838-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 14.97,
      "end": 18.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "sha256": "2c9634a4521a75e1441959a659fdfcec77126ae7f0eb99ef459c986a507b2ac6"
    },
    {
      "no": 840,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我想了很久，还是没决定去哪儿。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ xiǎng le hěn jiǔ, háishi méi juédìng qù nǎr.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0840-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 18.08,
      "end": 20.885,
      "duration_seconds": 2.805,
      "sha256": "78f36f6232e2ecc0f411d33268f8724063d9b771309182bd3f1818884f24d3b7"
    },
    {
      "no": 841,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "你有没有更简单一点儿的办法？",
      "pinyin": "Nǐ yǒu méi yǒu gèng jiǎndān yìdiǎnr de bànfǎ?",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0841-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 20.885,
      "end": 23.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.215,
      "sha256": "2d08cf77263d07db06c961ff4441b5977573108d4a0d59535a344eb08e7f2791"
    },
    {
      "no": 869,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "吃完药以后，可以喝点儿水吗？",
      "pinyin": "Chīwán yào yǐhòu, kěyǐ hē diǎnr shuǐ ma?",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0869-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 23.1,
      "end": 25.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "sha256": "b7d1fec3f886b00ad0f94fdd2df0e0dba0ebf84b0679ea212339714dd21def5a"
    },
    {
      "no": 878,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "爷爷老了，上楼要慢一点儿。",
      "pinyin": "Yéye lǎo le, shànglóu yào màn yìdiǎnr.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0878-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 25.64,
      "end": 27.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "sha256": "5568b88e1ee3cc647dfa6a21c219fbe40caedbf55ad1cbbfdeec1931e7ffe874"
    },
    {
      "no": 879,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "快一点儿，电影就要开始了。",
      "pinyin": "Kuài yìdiǎnr, diànyǐng jiù yào kāishǐ le.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0879-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 27.95,
      "end": 29.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "sha256": "6ef8c21a440fff3d6557ecccdcb57aa700e265a2d3059b0e47e3c76e908103c5"
    },
    {
      "no": 880,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "请你说慢一点儿，我想记下来。",
      "pinyin": "Qǐng nǐ shuō màn yìdiǎnr, wǒ xiǎng jì xiàlái.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0880-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 29.97,
      "end": 32.355,
      "duration_seconds": 2.385,
      "sha256": "412f765511ba9bb0d20d46af5bb973df00f1de10b4beddeffcb211c02387fe96"
    },
    {
      "no": 885,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "你这件新衣服真漂亮，在哪儿买的？",
      "pinyin": "Nǐ zhè jiàn xīn yīfu zhēn piàoliang, zài nǎr mǎi de?",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0885-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 32.355,
      "end": 35.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.795,
      "sha256": "00cac9eaeeb009d3828bd91858a7ab11db488162f059642f6ba7529eb6a3cdcf"
    },
    {
      "no": 887,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我写的字有点儿难看，还得多练。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ xiě de zì yǒudiǎnr nánkàn, hái děi duō liàn.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0887-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 35.15,
      "end": 37.645,
      "duration_seconds": 2.495,
      "sha256": "8eba9492e8091658c6fc14f3b0d4955b5e4c2e97742629214445b6fdd42c57c5"
    },
    {
      "no": 894,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "今天比昨天冷，多穿点儿衣服。",
      "pinyin": "Jīntiān bǐ zuótiān lěng, duō chuān diǎnr yīfu.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0894-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 37.645,
      "end": 40.095,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "sha256": "2464038d99a3ec14534e6c348e8253955494e58479af446941e8aeae5916b897"
    },
    {
      "no": 895,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "这条路比较近，我们走这儿吧。",
      "pinyin": "Zhè tiáo lù bǐjiào jìn, wǒmen zǒu zhèr ba.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0895-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 40.095,
      "end": 42.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.485,
      "sha256": "eb0b6edf9cb08e0bab11980649f8f6e44671b732be75e0d48782dff1f612354d"
    },
    {
      "no": 907,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我昨天没睡好，所以今天有点儿累。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ zuótiān méi shuìhǎo, suǒyǐ jīntiān yǒudiǎnr lèi.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0907-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 42.58,
      "end": 45.275,
      "duration_seconds": 2.695,
      "sha256": "e468f1fa157f22aab0f1dada0cc4af146effc1dd69eb232bae711288447f353c"
    },
    {
      "no": 912,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我没有生气，只是觉得有点儿累。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ méi yǒu shēngqì, zhǐshì juéde yǒudiǎnr lèi.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0912-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 45.275,
      "end": 47.885,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "sha256": "173eaee612bf5fe9875e53b877ae1a644c53f23017239cc637f3352737e7df7c"
    },
    {
      "no": 919,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "从这儿到车站大概要走二十分钟。",
      "pinyin": "Cóng zhèr dào chēzhàn dàgài yào zǒu èrshí fēnzhōng.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0919-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 47.885,
      "end": 50.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.595,
      "sha256": "9cb4a77c58313f684891f89efbc28858509673ca271ab66b23198ef85e1bfd55"
    },
    {
      "no": 950,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我正在写作业，晚点儿再聊吧。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ zhèngzài xiě zuòyè, wǎndiǎn r zài liáo ba.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0950-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 50.48,
      "end": 52.575,
      "duration_seconds": 2.095,
      "sha256": "ed6ea04a4577aa45a8276ede6c755549c787f0c65f9b9ec6dddfda76f68bfd5a"
    },
    {
      "no": 959,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "我的汉语还差一点儿，得多练习。",
      "pinyin": "Wǒ de Hànyǔ hái chà yìdiǎnr, děi duō liànxí.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0959-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 52.575,
      "end": 55.145,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "sha256": "f54a16c21b57b8d56349cc83c04aa52360b082c795040d59f9336f3dc45df8fe"
    },
    {
      "no": 987,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "今天有点儿事，我得先走了。",
      "pinyin": "Jīntiān yǒudiǎnr shì, wǒ děi xiān zǒu le.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0987-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 55.145,
      "end": 57.185,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "sha256": "f60751e5792b9ea951d400e7f0383e603ef365f3ddcb935db20170b224980b9a"
    },
    {
      "no": 993,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "听了这个故事，我有一点儿难过。",
      "pinyin": "Tīng le zhège gùshi, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr nánguò.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0993-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 57.185,
      "end": 59.605,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "sha256": "b7cb11ce17bdd5c69401a5c6d3a1756d41c1b5e5db8cd5a8db057ce11fe4ed8c"
    },
    {
      "no": 997,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "最近我胖了一点儿，得多运动。",
      "pinyin": "Zuìjìn wǒ pàng le yìdiǎnr, děi duō yùndòng.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0997-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 59.605,
      "end": 62.035,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "sha256": "d14aaa41b4c32fbd2462695e6b06484291060b76545c8d1eeca0db4542c181b0"
    },
    {
      "no": 998,
      "kind": "example",
      "text": "最近他瘦了，我有点儿担心。",
      "pinyin": "Zuìjìn tā shòu le, wǒ yǒudiǎnr dānxīn.",
      "file": "audio/level3-erhua/item3-0998-example.mp3",
      "source_chunk": 4,
      "start": 62.035,
